		"DevComment": "Sudden hard runs away from you (Bonefish). T-049/T-050 even-fight tune (2026-09-24, docs/specs/reel-fight-rules.md): the hook set opens with Shake (weight 0: only the opening move, a moderate 1.2x pull for 1.6-2.2 s) so the pressure ramps in; then the fish keeps pulling (Swim 2.0x, Rest 1.5x) and makes frequent short hard Runs (2.8x, 1.0-1.6 s): ease off during a run (holding reel through one takes the starter line to its limit and snaps it on bigger or rarer bonefish), reel while it swims or rests. With DT_FishFight StaminaPerStat 18 the fish tires over the whole fight instead of in its first second. PLACEHOLDER numbers."
